      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_5",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Hey Kaleh, are you in there?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Nym, is that you?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Yes, come on out already. The storm has passed. With the morning light Naia has ended the terrible night."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Has the sky really stopped falling?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("I already told you, the sky is clear and empty. Now come quickly, silly, others may need our help."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("What’s happened? Oh Eloh! The craters are everywhere. Everything is gone, ruined! I can hardly recognize our village. I didn’t think it could be this bad."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Come on, Kaleh, we have to go see if anyone is hurt or needs help. I think I hear people calling from the south. Now is not a time for fear, we must be strong. After all you are the nephew of Tanuil, our leader, and you must answer the call of duty. Perhaps in the light of day things won’t be as bad as you think. Let’s explore the village and see who else has survived the night."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Wait, our keep is just to the east. Our leader Tanuil must surely be recruiting others to help deal with the devastation. Perhaps we should go to the keep, before we explore the rest of the village."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: "26-33",
            y: "18-25",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Tanuil’s keep, our beautiful fortress, it is destroyed. How will we summon our people to battle?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("We must rally those survivors we can find amidst the rubble. It doesn’t look like anyone survived, but at least we can thank Eloh it was a quick death. But come on, we can’t dwell on the dead, we must help the living."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("But if Tanuil is dead, who will lead us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("That’s a question for another time. Let’s keep exploring the wreckage."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_7",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
