          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_36",
        on: "xanthos_appearance",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Xanthos",
            type: "Necromancer",
            side: 3,
            x: 36,
            y: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Xanthos",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_side",
            side: 3,
            gold: 300,
            income: 21,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:clear_shroud",
            side: 1,
            xs: "34-38",
            ys: "2-6",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Xanthos",
            text: _("This place reeks of death, I could smell it from miles away. Oh, how I love it, it is the smell of power, the inevitable triumph of death over life. Puny elves, I shall use the corpses of your families to create an army of undead! All shall bow down before Xanthos the Necromancer!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            portrait: "portraits/nym_moody.webp",
            text: _("His timing couldn’t be worse. I know that undead cultists often prey on small targets, but they haven’t had the guts to attack us for years. Why has Eloh heaped so much misfortune upon us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Have some more faith, girl, the goddess does not send us more than we can handle. With Eloh’s grace we shall yet triumph over this pretender."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garak",
            text: _("Bah, I’ve fought these dark cultists before. They can be killed just like anyone else, and our riders can easily defeat their skeleton armies."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("I have heard of your kind, foul necromancer. You travel the sands, daring to bring back and enslave those who have passed on. But we will prove to you that death is not all-powerful. You shall not desecrate the bodies of my kith and kin! You shall learn to fear the wrath of Eloh and the Quenoth Elves!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:place_shroud",
            side: 1,
            xs: "34-38",
            ys: "2-6",
            radius: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_37",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: "29-49",
            y: "0-11",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "xanthos_appearance",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Some of our people felt crowded in the village, and wanted to live out on the open sands. They thought they could flee to the safety of our walls if danger came. I shudder to imagine what may have become of them."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_40",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
