          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("The necromancer is dead, but I don’t think we’ve explored the entire village. There may still be elves that need rescuing. We should go back and check."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
