        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("What’s that to the north? It looks like even more undead! The rock storm must have attracted other necromancers. There’s no way we can defeat them all. We’ve run out of time. There’s no escape. Eloh save us!"),
          },
        ],
      },
